sequenceDiagram
  actor P as Parent
  participant API as StoriesEditorService
  participant N as NarrationService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as narration queue
  participant WK as Narration Worker
  participant AI as AI Service (VieNeu-TTS)
  participant CL as Cloudinary
  P->>API: POST /stories/:id/review
  API->>DB: findReviewGaps (pages, checkpoints complete)
  alt gaps found
    API-->>P: 422 list of missing parts
  end
  API->>DB: assertNoBlockedKeywords
  API->>DB: set reviewed_at, status
  API->>N: prepareNarration(tx) -> narration_clips(queued) per segment
  N->>Q: dispatch jobs (concurrency 1)
  API-->>P: story detail + narration progress
  Q->>WK: clip job
  WK->>DB: markGenerating
  WK->>AI: POST /v1/tts/synthesize (text with real names, private only)
  AI->>CL: upload MP3 (type=authenticated)
  AI-->>WK: audio key, duration
  WK->>DB: persistClip(audioKey, ready)
  Note over P,DB: Story is "ready for child" only when reviewed and all clips ready
